==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/pʌɪˈniːəl ˌɡland/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[pineal]] [[gland]]}}

# {{anatomy}} A small, pinecone-shaped [[endocrine gland]] found near the centre of the brain that produces [[melatonin]].

====Synonyms====
* [[epiphysis]]
* [[pineal body]]

